# Vendor electrode-coordinate files are NOT committed.
#
# These come from the cap manufacturers. None of them grants redistribution --
# they are simply downloadable (EGI), or gated behind a customer login
# (Brain Products). This repository is public and BSD-3 licensed, so vendor
# files are kept local and out of git.
#
# See README.md in this directory for where to obtain each set.

*.bvef
*.sfp
*.elc
*.xls
*.xlsx
*.zip

# Lab-measured montages ARE committed. These are our own digitizations, not a
# vendor's product, so the redistribution problem above does not apply to them
# -- and if they were ignored, rebuilding the library from a fresh clone would
# silently drop them.
!prerau/*.bvef
